# SvelteKit Frontend Review Checklist

Use when reviewing `frontend/` changes.

## Architecture

- [ ] API types/responses align with `docs/api-doc.md`
- [ ] `PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL` used; no hardcoded backend URL
- [ ] No secrets or private env vars in client bundle

## Auth & security

- [ ] JWT attached to protected API calls
- [ ] 401 handling (redirect/re-login)
- [ ] Login route exists; dashboard guarded

## Correctness & UX

- [ ] Metrics and expiring list match API response shapes
- [ ] Date range filter works (`days` or `from`/`to`)
- [ ] Status badges cover all relevant statuses
- [ ] Loading, empty, and error states handled
- [ ] Paginated lists use `total`/`limit`/`offset` correctly

## Code quality

- [ ] Types in `types.ts`; fetch logic in `api.ts`
- [ ] Components focused; no business logic duplicated from backend
- [ ] 2-space indent; consistent naming

## Tests

- [ ] Component/utility tests for non-trivial logic (if present)

## Output format

List issues by severity with file path and fix. State "no blockers found" if clean.
